# ObjectSim sample: a wedge ramp, 4 m long (x), 3 m wide (z), 1.5 m high.
# Low end at x = -2, high end at x = +2, base on y = 0. Written by hand with
# quads so the loader's polygon triangulation is exercised.
v -2.0 0.0 -1.5
v  2.0 0.0 -1.5
v  2.0 1.5 -1.5
v -2.0 0.0  1.5
v  2.0 0.0  1.5
v  2.0 1.5  1.5
# bottom
f 1 2 5 4
# back (high end)
f 2 3 6 5
# slope
f 1 4 6 3
# sides
f 1 3 2
f 4 5 6
